flowchart TD
  Boot[Boot ESP32] --> InitSerial[Initialiser Serial]
  InitSerial --> InitOLED[Initialiser OLED]
  InitOLED --> LoadPrefs["Charger Preferences (ssid, pass, kfactor, mqtt)"]
  LoadPrefs --> HasSSID{SSID connu?}
  
  HasSSID -- oui --> Connect[Tentative de connexion WiFi]
  HasSSID -- non --> StartAP[Demarrer AP Pinty]
  
  Connect -- succes --> ConnectMQTT[Connexion MQTT TLS 8883]
  Connect -- echec --> StartAP

  ConnectMQTT -- succes --> NormalMode[Mode Normal MQTT]
  ConnectMQTT -- echec --> RetryMQTT[Retry MQTT toutes les 5s]

  StartAP --> APWait["Serveur config (/ , /save , /reset)"]
  APWait --> Save{Form soumis?}
  Save -- save --> Restart[Enregistrer prefs & restart]
  Save -- reset --> ResetTotal[Remet totalLitres a 0]

  NormalMode --> SubscribeTopics[Subscribe pinty/dev01/cmd]
  SubscribeTopics --> AttachInt[Attach interruption capteur]
  AttachInt --> Loop[Loop principal]

  subgraph LoopCycle [Boucle principale]
    Loop --> MQTTLoop[client.loop - Ecoute commandes]
    MQTTLoop --> EverySecond[Chaque seconde: calcul debit & total]
    EverySecond --> UpdateOLED["MAJ ecran: wifi, mqtt, buffer, debit, total"]
    EverySecond --> BufferIfOffline{MQTT connecte?}
    BufferIfOffline -- non --> AddBuffer[Ajouter datapoint au buffer]
    BufferIfOffline -- oui --> PublishDirect[PUBLISH flow + total]
    Loop --> CheckBuffer[Si buffer présent et MQTT OK]
    CheckBuffer --> SendBatch[PUBLISH batch -> vider buffer]
  end

  Loop --> ReconnectCheck[Verifier connexion MQTT]
  ReconnectCheck --> MQTTDown{Déconnecté?}
  MQTTDown -- oui --> ReconnectMQTT[Tentative reconnexion immediate]
  MQTTDown -- non --> Continue[Continuer loop]

  PublishDirect --> UpdateStatus[mqttStatus = OK/ERR]
  SendBatch --> UpdateStatus2[mqttStatus = SYNC/ERR]
  AddBuffer --> UpdateStatus3[MQTT: WAIT buffer actif]

  ResetTotal --> UpdateOLED
  Restart --> Boot

  style StartAP fill:#f9f,stroke:#333,stroke-width:1px
  style NormalMode fill:#9f9,stroke:#333,stroke-width:1px
  style LoopCycle fill:#eef,stroke:#333,stroke-width:1px  style ConnectMQTT fill:#9cf,stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px